memorypackcpp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(memorypack CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE memorypack::memorypack)

Then include the umbrella header:

    #include "memorypack/memorypack.hpp"

    struct LoginRequest { std::string userName; int32_t level; };
    MEMORYPACK_DEFINE(LoginRequest, userName, level)

Optional TCP framing helpers live in "memorypack/packet.hpp".
